Name: Google BOQ & Wiz Resumable Signals Runtime
Short Name: boq-wiz
URL: https://github.com/angular/angular
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Version: 20.0.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/angular
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/angular

Description:
Google's internal production web architecture combining BOQ (window.WIZ_global_data, batchexecute RPC framing with XSSI prefix, AF_initDataCallback streaming SSR islands) and Wiz + Angular Signals zero-eager-hydration jsaction event delegation.

Local Modifications:
- Ported from google-bun/packages/google-stack into yolo-bun/packages/yolo-bun-plugin (yolo-bun:google-stack).
- Integrated natively with Bun.serve() for instant Chromium SSR and RPC batching.
